Sat Oct 10 15:00:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- First version of NazoOS Update (Python, PySide6, Kirigami):
  * nazoos-update-check.timer: refreshes repositories every 6 hours
    and stores pending "zypper dup" changes and Flatpak updates in
    /var/lib/nazoos-update/status.json
  * nazoos-update-notify.timer (user): notifications for updates,
    conflicts, failing checks, needed restarts and a boot from a
    read-only snapshot, each with a button that opens the window
  * Window: list of pending updates, "Update now" (zypper dup +
    Flatpak, snapshot via snapper-zypp-plugin), restart button
  * Rollback: after starting a read-only snapshot from GRUB,
    "Make permanent" runs snapper --ambit classic rollback
  * Discover's update notifications are switched off
  * German translation
